---
// Before/after visual comparing flat 1px-bordered form controls against
// subtle recessed inset shadows (for inputs and toggle tracks) paired with
// a raised primary button (1px overhead highlight + tight contact shadow).
const W = 900;
const H = 330;
---
<figure class="dri">
  <div class="dri-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before and after comparison of a profile form. Left shows flat 1px borders on the email input, toggle switch, and save button so every element sits on the same plane. Right shows a recessed email input and toggle track with top inner shadows and bottom highlights, paired with a raised toggle knob and raised save button with a bright top edge and tight bottom shadow.">
      <!-- LEFT PANEL: Before (flat 1px borders) -->
      <rect x="24" y="18" width="410" height="292" rx="10" class="dri-panel" />
      <text x="46" y="46" class="dri-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Before: flat 1px borders everywhere</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trước: viền 1px phẳng lì cho mọi thứ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="46" y="66" class="dri-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Inputs, tracks, and buttons share one flat plane</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ô nhập, thanh gạt và nút bấm nằm chung một mặt phẳng</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Left form card -->
      <rect x="46" y="82" width="366" height="208" rx="8" class="dri-card" />

      <text x="66" y="108" class="dri-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Work email</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Email công việc</tspan>
      </text>
      <!-- Flat input -->
      <rect x="66" y="116" width="326" height="38" rx="6" class="dri-flat-input" />
      <text x="80" y="140" class="dri-input-val">khang@example.com</text>

      <!-- Flat toggle row -->
      <rect x="66" y="174" width="46" height="24" rx="12" class="dri-flat-track" />
      <circle cx="98" cy="186" r="9" class="dri-flat-thumb" />
      <text x="124" y="191" class="dri-row-txt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Deploy alerts</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thông báo triển khai</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Flat button -->
      <rect x="66" y="222" width="144" height="40" rx="7" class="dri-btn-body" />
      <text x="138" y="247" text-anchor="middle" class="dri-btn-txt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Save profile</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu hồ sơ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="224" y="247" class="dri-muted-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Nothing feels pressable</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không rõ phần nào bấm được</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- RIGHT PANEL: After (recessed + raised) -->
      <rect x="466" y="18" width="410" height="292" rx="10" class="dri-panel" />
      <text x="488" y="46" class="dri-h is-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>After: recessed slots + raised controls</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: rãnh lõm sâu + nút điều khiển nổi</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="488" y="66" class="dri-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Carved inputs pull inward; buttons lift toward you</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ô nhập lõm xuống nền; nút bấm nổi lên đón thao tác</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Right form card -->
      <rect x="488" y="82" width="366" height="208" rx="8" class="dri-card" />

      <text x="508" y="108" class="dri-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Work email</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Email công việc</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="834" y="108" text-anchor="end" class="dri-callout-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Top inset shadow + lit bottom</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bóng lõm trên + mép dưới sáng</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Recessed input -->
      <rect x="508" y="116" width="326" height="38" rx="6" class="dri-recessed-input" />
      <rect x="510" y="117" width="322" height="5" rx="3" class="dri-inner-shadow" />
      <line x1="514" y1="154" x2="828" y2="154" class="dri-bottom-rim" />
      <text x="522" y="140" class="dri-input-val">khang@example.com</text>

      <!-- Recessed toggle track + raised thumb -->
      <rect x="508" y="174" width="46" height="24" rx="12" class="dri-recessed-track" />
      <rect x="512" y="175" width="38" height="4" rx="2" class="dri-inner-shadow" />
      <line x1="516" y1="198" x2="546" y2="198" class="dri-bottom-rim" />
      <!-- Raised thumb shadow + body -->
      <circle cx="540" cy="188" r="9" class="dri-knob-shadow" />
      <circle cx="540" cy="186" r="9" class="dri-raised-thumb" />
      <text x="566" y="191" class="dri-row-txt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Recessed track, raised knob</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Rãnh gạt lõm, nút gạt nổi</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Raised primary button: contact shadow + body + 1px top highlight -->
      <rect x="508" y="226" width="144" height="40" rx="7" class="dri-btn-shadow" />
      <rect x="508" y="222" width="144" height="40" rx="7" class="dri-btn-body" />
      <line x1="515" y1="224" x2="645" y2="224" class="dri-btn-top-light" />
      <text x="580" y="247" text-anchor="middle" class="dri-btn-txt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Save profile</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu hồ sơ</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Annotation next to raised button -->
      <text x="666" y="238" class="dri-callout-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Lit top edge +</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mép trên bắt sáng +</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="666" y="255" class="dri-muted-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>tight bottom shadow</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>bóng gọn dưới đáy</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pairing recessed inputs and toggle tracks with a raised button immediately clarifies what accepts text and what can be clicked—without heavy outlines.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đặt ô nhập liệu và rãnh gạt lõm cạnh nút bấm nổi giúp mắt phân biệt ngay đâu là chỗ gõ chữ, đâu là nút nhấn — không cần vẽ viền dày.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dri { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dri-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dri svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dri text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .dri-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dri text.dri-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dri text.dri-h.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .dri text.dri-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dri-card { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dri text.dri-lbl { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .dri-flat-input { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .dri-recessed-input { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dri-inner-shadow { fill: var(--text); opacity: 0.14; }
  .dri-bottom-rim { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.75; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.7; }
  .dri text.dri-input-val { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dri-flat-track { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .dri-flat-thumb { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .dri-recessed-track { fill: var(--border); opacity: 0.85; }
  .dri-knob-shadow { fill: var(--text); opacity: 0.22; }
  .dri-raised-thumb { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 0.75; }
  .dri text.dri-row-txt { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .dri-btn-shadow { fill: var(--text); opacity: 0.24; }
  .dri-btn-body { fill: var(--red); }
  .dri-btn-top-light { stroke: #f2a99c; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.9; }
  .dri text.dri-btn-txt { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: #ffffff; }
  .dri text.dri-callout-red { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--red); }
  .dri text.dri-muted-note { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dri figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
